$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=harmub  LOC_AFTER=?

* The harmonic sum up to M / D is at most 1 + log M, for D in ( 1 ... M ).

s1::simpl |- ( ( M e. NN /\ D e. ( 1 ... M ) ) -> M e. NN )
s2::simpr |- ( ( M e. NN /\ D e. ( 1 ... M ) ) -> D e. ( 1 ... M ) )
